<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
  <h1 style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 40%, var(--accent-secondary) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: 0;">
    Your privacy is respected. Learn about how this static website handles data.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; line-height: 1.8;">
  <h3>1. No Personal Data Collection</h3>
  <p>
    This website is a static portal and does not request, collect, or store any personal data. There are no user accounts, registration forms, or tracking databases.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">2. Cookies</h3>
  <p>
    We do not use tracking cookies, marketing cookies, or third-party analytic tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">3. Hosting & Server Logs</h3>
  <p>
    This website is hosted using **GitHub Pages**. GitHub may collect basic network traffic log data (such as IP addresses, user agent headers, and date/time of access) to ensure service security and reliability. This logging is governed by <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">4. Local Playground Operations</h3>
  <p>
    All operations in the Interactive Playground/Validator execute entirely within your local browser sandbox. No values typed into the validator are sent over the network or saved to external servers.
  </p>
</div>
